# Operator decision 2026-09-25 (licensing): audio captures of the games' music are never committed.
# Keep them local; record each capture's sha256 and the numbers derived from it in the result files.
*.ogg
*.OGG
*.wav
*.WAV
*.opus
*.OPUS
*.flac
*.FLAC
*.mp3
*.MP3
# Coordinator decision 2026-09-26: run-created AGS saves stay local too -- they embed game state and a
# screenshot thumbnail of game art, so they are closer to game data than to our results. Record each
# save's sha256 in SAVE-SHA256.txt per result dir. (Saves tracked before this line are left as they are.)
AGSSAVE.*
agssave.*
# Operator decision 2026-11-06 (AGS Quest licence, tests/harness/packages/agsquest/LICENSE-NOTES.md: "No screenshot of
# this package's rendered content is ever committed"): no image from an AGS Quest cell (AQ*, F1AQ*) enters git. Record
# each image's sha256 in the cell's IMAGE-SHA256.txt instead. Case-insensitive (PH0n.BMP is uppercase).
# Tag convention (2026-11-06, sdlports): every AGS Quest cell's tag contains "AQ" (AQ*, JAQ*, F1AQK, N7AQ ...) and no
# other cell's does, so the rule matches any round prefix. A new AGS Quest cell must keep "AQ" in its tag.
*AQ*/**/*.[bB][mM][pP]
*AQ*/**/*.[pP][nN][gG]
*AQ*/**/*.[jJ][pP][gG]
*AQ*/**/*.[jJ][pP][eE][gG]
*AQ*/**/*.[gG][iI][fF]
# Operator decision 2026-11-06 (relayed by sdlports): these three dirs' send/collect witness frames show the old echoing
# FTP session with a credential; untracked from HEAD (no history rewrite), kept on disk, sha256 in IMAGE-SHA256.txt.
# Never pick a README or gallery frame from them. New frames: tests/harness/witness-ftp-check.sh before committing.
IO41-2026-09-28/WITNESS-*.jpg
IOA0-2026-09-28/WITNESS-*.jpg
IOES-2026-09-28/WITNESS-*.jpg
